Legends YT-DLP Slayer is a wrapper and operator control plane. It does not
contain, fork, or reimplement yt-dlp, YouTube, or Mullvad VPN.

Third-party tools
-----------------

yt-dlp

- Project: https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp
- License: Unlicense
- Use in this repository: downloaded by the local operator through
  `slayer yt-dlp install`, verified against upstream SHA2-256SUMS, and executed
  as an external child process.
- Distribution note: this source repository and alpha package do not bundle the
  yt-dlp executable. If a future package bundles yt-dlp, include the upstream
  license text and any current upstream notices in that package.

Mullvad VPN

- Product: https://mullvad.net
- App source: https://github.com/mullvad/mullvadvpn-app
- App license: GPL-3.0
- Use in this repository: controls the official Mullvad CLI installed by the
  user's local Mullvad VPN app.
- Distribution note: this project does not bundle Mullvad VPN, Mullvad CLI, or
  Mullvad assets. Users install and license Mullvad separately.

